// ============================================================================
// [P2.2a] Circuit 6 (merkle_update): trace_length = 512, depth = 15 (canonical
// production depth — see apps/mobile + tests/p01-stark-verifier.test.ts).
// Periodic polynomials are depth-dependent because active_rows = depth * 32
// masks values; the verifier rejects proofs whose public_inputs[4] != 15.
// 7 periodic columns bind all 19 transition constraints via DEEP-ALI at a
// single OOD point z.
//
// Layout:
//   C6_RC0/RC1/RC2:        Poseidon t=3 round constants within each hash cycle
//                          (pos_in_cycle in 0..29, cycles 0..14 active).
//   C6_ROUND_ACTIVE:       1 on active Poseidon rounds, 0 on cycle boundary /
//                          padding rows.
//   C6_HASH_START:         1 at the first row of each active cycle.
//   C6_IS_BOUNDARY:        1 at the last row of each active cycle (cycle
//                          boundary, carry refresh).
//   C6_IS_INTERIOR:        1 on all rounds of an active cycle except row 0
//                          (sibling/direction continuity).
//
// Regenerate with:
//   cargo test -p p01-stark --lib emit_circuit_6_periodic_coeffs -- --ignored --nocapture
// ============================================================================

